# Optional overrides. Copy to .env to use them; every value has a working default.
# Nothing here is secret. The read-only commands (snapshot, precheck, serve, `npm run mr`)
# never read a key and never sign. Only `npm run mr:live` signs, with MR_SIGNER_KEY taken
# from the environment of that one command after the owner approved the exact plan file;
# never put that key in this file or any other.

# Somnia Hideki ("Tokyo") testnet, chain 50383. Defaults come from
# @somnia-chain/markets-sdk/chains (hidekiTestnet).
# HIDEKI_RPC_URL=https://api.hideki2.infra.testnet.somnia.network
# HIDEKI_WS_URL=wss://api.hideki2.infra.testnet.somnia.network/ws

# dreamDEX (Somnia Markets) indexer for Hideki.
# DREAMDEX_INDEXER_URL=https://hideki-dev.smk.somnia.host/v1/graphql

# Order book levels read per side (1..100).
# BOOK_DEPTH=20

# Port for `npm run serve` (binds to 127.0.0.1 only).
# PORT=8787

# Margin Rescue fork tests: a local JSON-RPC shim in front of Hideki (npm run rpc-shim),
# the fork block, and the real account used by the ledger fork test.
# HIDEKI_FORK_RPC=http://127.0.0.1:8546
# FORK_BLOCK=33472615
# REAL_ACCOUNT=0x2E3631D9c6497103BE981Fe3a48B11ba06fDB745
